OL,3,GNEWSALego store builds on city's
OL,4,Ashopping success story
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe number of empty shops in a city
OL,7,Fcentre has fallen to its lowest number
OL,8,Fin 18 years as crowds gathered for the
OL,9,Fopening of a new Lego store.
OL,11,FA report by Norwich City Council said
OL,12,Fthe decision by companies such as Lego
OL,13,Fto open new outlets was proof the city
OL,14,Fwas "a good place to invest".
OL,16,FHundreds of people queued outside the
OL,17,FChantry Place shopping centre on
OL,18,FThursday ahead of the Danish toy giant
OL,19,Fopening its latest branch.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
