OL,3,GNEWSALego store builds on city's
OL,4,Ashopping success story
OL,5,
OL,6,FFigures from surveys the council
OL,7,Fconducted showed that 9.8% of retail
OL,8,Funits were empty last month, down from
OL,9,F15.2% in September last year.
